                &quot;quantity&quot;: 7,
                &quot;buy_direct&quot;: &quot;Yes&quot;,
                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Step into the world of unapologetic street style with this all-black Los Angeles California hoodie and jogger set &mdash; the ultimate blend of comfort, bold design, and pure urban energy. This two-piece outfit is made for trendsetters who refuse to blend in. The hoodie features large, distressed white &lsquo;Los Angeles California&rsquo; lettering across the chest, surrounded by unique street-inspired graphics and abstract flame designs that blaze down both sleeves. The details are sharp, fearless, and packed with personality &mdash; the kind of look that makes people turn their heads when you walk past.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe matching joggers take that same heat and carry it through the design with matching white flames and bold LA prints down the legs, giving you a perfectly coordinated look from top to bottom. Designed with an adjustable drawstring waistband, the pants provide the perfect fit while offering maximum comfort whether you&rsquo;re moving through the city, working out, or chilling with friends.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMade from high-quality, breathable fabric, this set feels soft on the inside yet holds its shape wear after wear. It&rsquo;s lightweight enough for all-day wear yet sturdy enough to withstand the hustle of urban life. Whether you&rsquo;re pairing it with fresh sneakers for that everyday street vibe or layering it under a jacket for cooler nights, this set adapts effortlessly to your style.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThis isn&rsquo;t just clothing &mdash; it&rsquo;s a statement. It&rsquo;s about repping the fearless, creative, and unstoppable energy that defines Los Angeles street culture. Perfect for photoshoots, night outings, skate sessions, or just owning your space wherever you go, this hoodie and jogger combo is for those who know fashion is more than what you wear &mdash; it&rsquo;s how you live.&quot;,
